{
  "name": "AI Customer Support Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "support-agent",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Customer Message (Webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "support-agent-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a friendly customer support agent for 'Demo Store'. Reply in the same language the customer writes in (English, Urdu, or Roman Urdu). Keep answers short, clear and polite.\n\nCOMPANY INFORMATION (replace with your own company details):\n- Working hours: Monday to Saturday, 10 AM to 8 PM.\n- Delivery: 3 to 5 days; free delivery on orders above 2000 PKR.\n- Return policy: unused items can be returned within 7 days.\n- Payment methods: Cash on Delivery, JazzCash, EasyPaisa, Bank Transfer.\n- Support email: support@demostore.com\n- Phone: 0300-0000000\n\nRULES:\n1. Answer only using the information above. If you do not know the answer, do not guess.\n2. If the customer is angry, asks for a refund or complaint, or you cannot answer, say you are connecting them to a human team member, and end your reply with this exact tag: [HANDOFF]\n3. Never ask the customer for passwords, card numbers or OTPs."
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "AI Support Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [320, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Customer Message (Webhook)').item.json.body.sessionId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Conversation Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [420, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "name": "needsHuman",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.includes('[HANDOFF]') }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2",
              "name": "reply",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.replace('[HANDOFF]', '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "value": "={{ $('Customer Message (Webhook)').item.json.body.sessionId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f4",
              "name": "originalMessage",
              "value": "={{ $('Customer Message (Webhook)').item.json.body.message }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Check Handoff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [640, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"reply\": $json.reply, \"needsHuman\": $json.needsHuman } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Send Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [860, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.needsHuman }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Needs Human?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1080, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "support-team@demostore.com",
        "subject": "🚨 Customer Handoff Required — Session {{ $json.sessionId }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<h2>Customer Needs Human Support</h2><p><strong>Session ID:</strong> {{ $json.sessionId }}</p><p><strong>Customer Message:</strong></p><blockquote>{{ $json.originalMessage }}</blockquote><p><strong>AI Reply Sent:</strong></p><blockquote>{{ $json.reply }}</blockquote><p>Please follow up with this customer as soon as possible.</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Alert Team (Gmail)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1300, -120],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Customer Support Agent\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Add your OpenAI credential in the OpenAI Chat Model node.\n2. Edit the System Message in the 'AI Support Agent' node with your company details.\n3. Add your Gmail credential in the 'Alert Team (Gmail)' node and set the support team email.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n**Flow:**\nWebhook → AI Agent → Check Handoff → Send Reply\n                                    ↓\n                             Needs Human? (IF)\n                            /              \\\n                     Yes (true)          No (false)\n                         ↓                  ↓\n               Alert Team (Gmail)      (no action)\n\n**Test (curl):**\ncurl -X POST <WEBHOOK_URL> -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"sessionId\":\"u1\",\"message\":\"How long does delivery take?\"}'\n\n**Handoff test:**\ncurl -X POST <WEBHOOK_URL> -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"sessionId\":\"u2\",\"message\":\"I want a refund now!\"}'",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -420]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Customer Message (Webhook)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Support Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Support Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Conversation Memory": {
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Support Agent",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Support Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Handoff",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Handoff": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Reply": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Needs Human?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Needs Human?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert Team (Gmail)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false
}
